t/jibu/1230/34640.html，2026-10-16 访问；以识典古籍影印本《杜诗详注》卷七（清·仇兆鳌撰，四库全书本）与清刻本《杜诗论文》卷十二（清·吴见思撰）对校。异文校记见 docs/sources/dream-li-bai-intake.md。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,493][944,922]" /><node index="4" text="异文" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,989][214,1040]" /><node index="5" text="•" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,1061][153,1113]" /><node index="6" text="出门搔白首，若负平生志 —— 底本《全唐诗》作「若」；清刻本《杜诗论文》卷十二作「苦」，《杜诗详注》卷七于「若」下出校语「一作苦」。两读皆有本可据，本仓从底本作「若」。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[174,1061][944,1485]" /><node index="7" text="•" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[137,1510][153,1562]" /><node index="8" text="江湖多风波 —— 底本《全唐诗》作「多风波」，《杜诗详注》卷七出校语「一云秋多风」。本仓从底本，不取「秋多风」。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="dev.sopho.suofei" content-desc="" checkable="false" c